## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

CTRL+PATH is an academic guidance platform for first-year BSIT students at Batangas State University – Alangilan.

It helps students explore three academic tracks:

- **NT — Networking Technology:** Blue `#2563EB`
- **BA — Business Analytics:** Violet `#8B5CF6`
